  "promptHtml": "What are three important counselling points related to both bacterial and viral conjunctivitis? ",
  "answerHtml": "1. Advise regarding self limiting nature <br>2. Highly contagious for 48-72 hours; minimize contact and item sharing, ensure handwashing <br>3. Cleanse affected eye(s) by wiping from inner to outward with a single tissue <br>4. Clean eyelashes several times per day with warm water <br>5. Cold compresses for comfort <br>6. Avoid contact lenses while sleeping, showering, or swimming to reduce chance of conjunctivitis <br>7. If poor reponse to topical medications for 2-3 days, consider resistant bacterial infection or other non-infectious cause ",
