  "answerHtml": "1. Signficant soft tissue infection<br>2. Widespread disease <br>3. Community outbreak<br>4. Immunocompromised <br>5. Systemic symptoms (bacteremia)<br>6. Suspected MRSA<br>7. Failed topical therapy ",
